 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"1795745677:FvASx2KkDLuDjSSwtsKvuJzKi9HS0x4y7kTWLYYHhCY=\">\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112609'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解 P2669 【金币】 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"79f7f3bn\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P2669 \\u3010\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u3011\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1531219016,\"author\":{\"uid\":76561,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/76561.png\",\"name\":\"right_cat\",\"slogan\":\"\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Gray\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"\"},\"upvote\":5,\"replyCount\":1,\"favorCount\":1,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P2669\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2015 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u91d1\\u5e01\",\"difficulty\":1,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"\\u4e0b\\u9762\\u4ecb\\u7ecd\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u6570\\u5b66\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\u3002\\n\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u628a\\u7b2c1\\u5929\\u5206\\u6210\\u4e00\\u7ec4\\uff0c\\u7b2c2\\u548c\\u7b2c3\\u5929\\u5206\\u6210\\u4e8c\\u7ec4\\uff0c\\u7b2c4\\uff0c5\\uff0c6\\u5929\\u5206\\u6210\\u4e09\\u7ec4\\uff0c...\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u6b64\\u7c7b\\u63a8\\u3002\\n\\n\\u753b\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u56fe\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u7406\\u89e3\\uff1a\\n```\\n\\u7ec4\\u6570\\uff1a\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\uff1a\\n1\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t     1             \\/\\/\\u7b2c1\\u7ec4\\n2\\uff0c3\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t  3\\uff0c5          \\/\\/\\u7b2c2\\u7ec4\\n4\\uff0c5\\uff0c6                       8\\uff0c11\\uff0c14     \\/\\/\\u7b2c3\\u7ec4\\n7\\uff0c8\\uff0c9\\uff0c10                   18\\uff0c22\\uff0c26\\uff0c30\\/\\/\\u7b2c4\\u7ec4\\n...                           ...\\n```\\n\\u4e0d\\u96be\\u770b\\u51fa\\uff0c\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u5929\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\u4e3a\\uff1a1^2+2^2+3^2+...+n^2\\u3002\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5199\\u4e00\\u6bb5\\u4ee3\\u7801\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u8f93\\u5165\\u7684K\\u6070\\u597d\\u662f\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u5929\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u76f4\\u63a5\\u7b97\\u51fa\\u503c\\u5e76\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5982\\u679c\\u8f93\\u5165\\u7684K\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u5929\\uff0c\\u90a3\\u5c31\\u53ea\\u80fd\\u7b97\\u51fan\\u7684\\u503c\\u3002\\u4e0d\\u8fc7\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u4e0d\\u5b58\\u50a8n\\u7684\\u503c\\uff0c\\u800c\\u5b58\\u50a8n-1\\u7684\\u503c\\uff0c\\u539f\\u56e0\\u5f85\\u4f1a\\u513f\\u8bf4\\u3002\\n\\n\\u4e0a\\u9762\\u7684\\u601d\\u8def\\uff0c\\u6211\\u7528\\u4e86\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u4e00\\u6bb5\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u5b9e\\u73b0\\uff1a\\n```cpp\\nfor(i=1;;i++)\\n{\\n        sum+=i;                 \\/\\/\\u7d2f\\u52a0\\u5929\\u6570\\n        ans+=i*i;               \\/\\/\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\n        if(sum==k)              \\/\\/\\u5982\\u679c\\u6070\\u597d\\u662f\\u7b2ci\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u5929\\n        {\\n           printf(\\u0022%d\\\\n\\u0022,ans);  \\/\\/\\u5c31\\u8f93\\u51fa\\n           return 0;            \\/\\/\\u7136\\u540e\\u76f4\\u63a5\\u7ed3\\u675f\\n        }\\n        if(sum\\u003Ek) {t=i-1;break;}\\/\\/\\u5982\\u679cK\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u7b2ci\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u5929\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u7b97\\u51fai-1\\u7684\\u503c\\u5b58\\u5728t\\u4e2d\\n}\\n```\\n\\u63a5\\u4e0b\\u6765\\u4e3b\\u8981\\u89e3\\u51b3K\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u6700\\u540e\\u4e00\\u5929\\u7684\\u60c5\\u51b5\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u5df2\\u7ecf\\u6c42\\u51fa\\u4e86n-1\\u7684\\u503c\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8fd9\\u6837\\u601d\\u8003\\uff0c\\u5148\\u7b97\\u51faK\\u662f\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u54ea\\u4e00\\u5929\\uff0c\\u5047\\u8bbe\\u662f\\u7b2cd\\u5929\\u5427\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u6c42\\u5230\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u7b2c1\\u5929\\u5230\\u7b2cd\\u5929\\u7684\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\uff0c\\u518d\\u6c42\\u51fa\\u7b2c1\\u7ec4\\u5230\\u7b2cn-1\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\uff0c\\u4e24\\u8005\\u76f8\\u52a0\\uff0c\\u5c31\\u662f\\u6b63\\u786e\\u7b54\\u6848\\u3002\\n\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8fd9\\u4e48\\u5b9e\\u73b0\\uff1a\\n```cpp\\n\\tans=0;            \\/\\/\\u4e00\\u5b9a\\u8bb0\\u4f4f\\u5c06ans\\u6e05\\u96f6\\n    for(i=1;i\\u003C=t;i++) \\n        ans+=i*i;     \\/\\/\\u6c42\\u51fa\\u7b2c1\\u7ec4\\u5230\\u7b2cn-1\\u7ec4\\u7684\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\n    d=k-sum+t+1;      \\/\\/\\u6c42\\u5f97d\\u7684\\u503c\\n    ans+=d*(t+1);\\t  \\/\\/d*(t+1)\\u8868\\u793a\\u7b2cn\\u7ec4\\u7b2c1\\u5929\\u5230\\u7b2cd\\u5929\\u7684\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570,\\u5c06\\u4e24\\u503c\\u76f8\\u52a0\\n```\\n\\n\\u6700\\u540e\\u8f93\\u51fa\\u5c31\\u884c\\u4e86\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u7684\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u5982\\u4e0b\\uff1a\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Ccstdio\\u003E\\nint main()\\n{\\n    int k,sum=0,ans=0,t,d,i;\\n    scanf(\\u0022%d\\u0022,\\u0026k);\\n    for(i=1;;i++)\\n    {\\n        sum+=i;\\n        ans+=i*i;\\n        if(sum==k)\\n        {\\n           printf(\\u0022%d\\\\n\\u0022,ans);\\n           return 0;\\n        }\\n        if(sum\\u003Ek) {t=i-1;break;}\\n    }\\n    ans=0;\\n    for(i=1;i\\u003C=t;i++)\\n        ans+=i*i;\\n    d=k-sum+t+1;\\n    ans+=d*(t+1);\\n    printf(\\u0022%d\\\\n\\u0022,ans);\\n    return 0;\\n}\\n\\n```\",\"categoryOld\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795659277.157705}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/79f7f3bn\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P2669 \\u3010\\u91d1\\u5e01\\u3011\",\"description\":\"\\u4e0b\\u9762\\u4ecb\\u7ecd\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u6570\\u5b66\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\u3002\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u628a\\u7b2c1\\u5929\\u5206\\u6210\\u4e00\\u7ec4\\uff0c\\u7b2c2\\u548c\\u7b2c3\\u5929\\u5206\\u6210\\u4e8c\\u7ec4\\uff0c\\u7b2c4\\uff0c5\\uff0c6\\u5929\\u5206\\u6210\\u4e09\\u7ec4\\uff0c...\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u6b64\\u7c7b\\u63a8\\u3002\\n\\u753b\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u56fe\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u7406\\u89e3\\uff1a\\n\\u7ec4\\u6570\\uff1a                     \\u91d1\\u5e01\\u6570\\uff1a\\n1\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"right_cat\"},\"datePublished\":\"2018-07-10T18:36:56+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解 P2669 【金币】\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"下面介绍一种数学方法。\n我们把第1天分成一组，第2和第3天分成二组，第4，5，6天分成三组，...，以此类推。\n画一个图帮助理解：\n组数：                     金币数：\n1…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"right_cat\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2018-07-10T18:36:56+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/79f7f3bn\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解 P2669 【金币】</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">right_cat</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2018-07-10T18:36:56+08:00\">2018-07-10 18:36:56</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>下面介绍一种数学方法。</p>\n<p>我们把第1天分成一组，第2和第3天分成二组，第4，5，6天分成三组，...，以此类推。</p>\n<p>画一个图帮助理解：</p>\n<pre><code>组数：                     金币数：\n1                            1             //第1组\n2，3                       3，5          //第2组\n4，5，6                       8，11，14     //第3组\n7，8，9，10                   18，22，26，30//第4组\n...                           ...</code></pre>\n<p>不难看出，第n组最后一天金币数为：1^2+2^2+3^2+...+n^2。可以写一段代码，如果输入的K恰好是第n组的最后一天，就可以直接算出值并输出。</p>\n<p>如果输入的K不是第n组的最后一天，那就只能算出n的值。不过，我们不存储n的值，而存储n-1的值，原因待会儿说。</p>\n<p>上面的思路，我用了这样一段代码实现：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">for(i=1;;i++)\n{\n        sum+=i;                 //累加天数\n        ans+=i*i;               //计算金币数\n        if(sum==k)              //如果恰好是第i组的最后一天\n        {\n           printf(\"%d\\n\",ans);  //就输出\n           return 0;            //然后直接结束\n        }\n        if(sum&gt;k) {t=i-1;break;}//如果K不是第i组的最后一天，就算出i-1的值存在t中\n}</code></pre>\n<p>接下来主要解决K不是第n组最后一天的情况，我们已经求出了n-1的值，可以这样思考，先算出K是第n组的哪一天，假设是第d天吧，可以求到第n组第1天到第d天的金币数，再求出第1组到第n-1组的金币数，两者相加，就是正确答案。</p>\n<p>我们可以这么实现：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">    ans=0;            //一定记住将ans清零\n    for(i=1;i&lt;=t;i++) \n        ans+=i*i;     //求出第1组到第n-1组的金币数\n    d=k-sum+t+1;      //求得d的值\n    ans+=d*(t+1);     //d*(t+1)表示第n组第1天到第d天的金币数,将两值相加</code></pre>\n<p>最后输出就行了。</p>\n<p>完整的代码如下：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;cstdio&gt;\nint main()\n{\n    int k,sum=0,ans=0,t,d,i;\n    scanf(\"%d\",&amp;k);\n    for(i=1;;i++)\n    {\n        sum+=i;\n        ans+=i*i;\n        if(sum==k)\n        {\n           printf(\"%d\\n\",ans);\n           return 0;\n        }\n        if(sum&gt;k) {t=i-1;break;}\n    }\n    ans=0;\n    for(i=1;i&lt;=t;i++)\n        ans+=i*i;\n    d=k-sum+t+1;\n    ans+=d*(t+1);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",ans);\n    return 0;\n}\n</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a605616dfba4e3ae',t:'MTc5NTY1OTI3Ng=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a605616dfba4e3ae',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
